# WinZip AES AE-2 entry (no CRC) decrypts to more data than the uncompressed size in its header
features HAVE_CRYPTO
arguments test.zip set_password foofoofoo cat 1
return 1
file test.zip incons-aes-ae2-data-longer.zip
stdout
encrypted
end-of-inline-data
stderr
can't read file at index '1': Zip archive inconsistent: file length in header doesn't match actual file length
end-of-inline-data
